{"id":"d2d4ae7a9b4ff171","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-cone-topology-data.md","title":"Mapping Cone Quotient Topology","display":"df-cone-topology-data — Mapping Cone Quotient Topology","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-cone-topology-data","aliases":["58-df-cone-topology-data"],"display":"df-cone-topology-data — Mapping Cone Quotient Topology","depends_on":["[[58-df-mapping-cone.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-cone-topology-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-cone-topology-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cone-topology-data — Mapping Cone Quotient Topology"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4397ca2cdf99ab61\" href=\"?note=4397ca2cdf99ab61\" title=\"58-df-mapping-cone.md\">58-df-mapping-cone.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,\\tau_X,\\tau_Y,f,C\\in V\">\\(X,Y,\\tau_X,\\tau_Y,f,C\\in V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=[0,1]\">\\(I=[0,1]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_I=\\{W\\subseteq I:\\forall t\\in W\\;\\exists\\varepsilon&gt;0\\;(I\\cap(t-\\varepsilon,t+\\varepsilon)\\subseteq W)\\}\">\\(\\tau_I=\\{W\\subseteq I:\\forall t\\in W\\;\\exists\\varepsilon&gt;0\\;(I\\cap(t-\\varepsilon,t+\\varepsilon)\\subseteq W)\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z_f,\\iota_Y,\\iota_C,R_f,q_f\">\\(Z_f,\\iota_Y,\\iota_C,R_f,q_f\\)</span> 使用 <code>58-df-mapping-cone</code> 中同一组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,f\">\\(X,Y,f\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j_f(y)=q_f(\\iota_Y(y))\">\\(j_f(y)=q_f(\\iota_Y(y))\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ConeTopology}_{58,S}(\\tau_C,C,f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\">\\(\\operatorname{ConeTopology}_{58,S}(\\tau_C,C,f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\)</span> 为本文件的七元关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau_{X\\times I}:=\\{W\\subseteq X\\times I:{}&amp;\\forall\\langle x,t\\rangle\\in W\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau_X\\;\\exists V\\in\\tau_I\\;\n[x\\in U\\land t\\in V\\land U\\times V\\subseteq W]\\},\\\\\n\\tau_{Z_f}:=\\{O\\subseteq Z_f:{}&amp;\\iota_Y^{-1}[O]\\in\\tau_Y\\land\n\\{\\langle x,t\\rangle\\in X\\times I:\\iota_C(x,t)\\in O\\}\\in\\tau_{X\\times I}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ConeTopology}_{58,S}(\\tau_C,C,f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\n\\land\\operatorname{MappingCone}_S(C,f,X,Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\tau_C=\\{W\\subseteq C:q_f^{-1}[W]\\in\\tau_{Z_f}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau_{X\\times I}:=\\{W\\subseteq X\\times I:{}&amp;\\forall\\langle x,t\\rangle\\in W\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau_X\\;\\exists V\\in\\tau_I\\;\n[x\\in U\\land t\\in V\\land U\\times V\\subseteq W]\\},\\\\\n\\tau_{Z_f}:=\\{O\\subseteq Z_f:{}&amp;\\iota_Y^{-1}[O]\\in\\tau_Y\\land\n\\{\\langle x,t\\rangle\\in X\\times I:\\iota_C(x,t)\\in O\\}\\in\\tau_{X\\times I}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ConeTopology}_{58,S}(\\tau_C,C,f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\n\\land\\operatorname{MappingCone}_S(C,f,X,Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\tau_C=\\{W\\subseteq C:q_f^{-1}[W]\\in\\tau_{Z_f}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>输入拓扑、不交并拓扑和商拓扑都被展开；不存在从未结构化的载体猜测拓扑的步骤。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-mapping-cone.md","status":"resolved","id":"4397ca2cdf99ab61","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-mapping-cone.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y,\\tau_X,\\tau_Y,f,C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"I=[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_I=\\{W\\subseteq I:\\forall t\\in W\\;\\exists\\varepsilon>0\\;(I\\cap(t-\\varepsilon,t+\\varepsilon)\\subseteq W)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"Z_f,\\iota_Y,\\iota_C,R_f,q_f","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y,f","display":false},{"tex":"j_f(y)=q_f(\\iota_Y(y))","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ConeTopology}_{58,S}(\\tau_C,C,f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau_{X\\times I}:=\\{W\\subseteq X\\times I:{}&\\forall\\langle x,t\\rangle\\in W\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau_X\\;\\exists V\\in\\tau_I\\;\n[x\\in U\\land t\\in V\\land U\\times V\\subseteq W]\\},\\\\\n\\tau_{Z_f}:=\\{O\\subseteq Z_f:{}&\\iota_Y^{-1}[O]\\in\\tau_Y\\land\n\\{\\langle x,t\\rangle\\in X\\times I:\\iota_C(x,t)\\in O\\}\\in\\tau_{X\\times I}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ConeTopology}_{58,S}(\\tau_C,C,f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\n\\land\\operatorname{MappingCone}_S(C,f,X,Y)\\\\\n&\\land\\tau_C=\\{W\\subseteq C:q_f^{-1}[W]\\in\\tau_{Z_f}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1608,"backlinks":[{"id":"6da8e7b12b3b6d38","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-344","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cone-topology-data.md|58-df-cone-topology-data]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["4397ca2cdf99ab61","815e63e5071e7b58","3cd1834de4f2efb2"]}